.TH AMERIKA-SOFTWARE 1 "2026-10-21" "Amerika OS" "Amerika OS Manual"
.SH NAME
amerika\-software \- graphical manager for the Amerika package repository
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B amerika\-software
.RB [ \-\-list ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B amerika\-software
lists, installs, updates and removes the applications published in the signed Amerika repository
(https://www.amerika.social/apt). It is a Qt program; package changes are made by a Polkit\-guarded helper
.IR /usr/libexec/amerika\-software\-helper ,
so you type your own password and the program itself never runs as root.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-list
Print the catalogue as text and exit without opening a window.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /etc/apt/sources.list.d/amerika.sources
The repository definition (package amerika\-repo\-keyring).
.TP
.I /usr/share/polkit\-1/actions/org.amerika.software.policy
The Polkit action.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR apt (8),
.BR amerika\-channel (8),
.BR amerika\-flavour (7)
